TEXT 80 -160 Left 2 ;SIM 13 - FM in, audio out (end to end)
TEXT 80 -128 Left 2 ;Tests: a true APT FM signal through the IF chain, limiter, detector, audio chain and ADC.
TEXT 80 -96 Left 2 ;Result (RE4A = 270 ohm): THD 1.10 / 1.82 %, 0.45 / 0.42 Vpp at the ADC.
TEXT 80 -64 Left 2 ;Explained in fm_receiver/DESIGN_LOG.md, section 'SIM 13 - the money shot: FM in, audio out'. Old sheet notes: fm_receiver/sim_notes.md.
